 a) i b) i + 1 c) i - 1 d) n - i

Answer group for G
 a) * * O b) * O O c) O * * d) O O *
 * O O * * O O O * O * *
 O O O * * * O O O * * *

Answer group for H
 a) T(2) + T(3) = 3 ^ 2 b) T(2) + T(3) = 9
 c) T(2) + T(3) = S(3) d) T(3) + T(2) = 3 ^ 2
 e) T(3) + T(2) = 9 f) T(3) + T(2) = S(3)

